; Categorization rules, used by `kingsmint import`.
;   DATE custom "rule" "REGEX" Account
; REGEX is case-insensitive (write backslashes twice: "\\bBP\\b") and matched against
; "payee | narration | counterparty IBAN | amount", e.g. "Lidl 185 | Card payment | | -57.36".
; Optional "Account share" pairs after the account split off a share of the amount;
; the main account gets the rest.
; First matching rule wins, so put specific rules before general ones.
; A rule applies only to transactions on or after its DATE.
; After changing rules, run `uv run kingsmint reimport`.

; 2000-01-01 custom "rule" "\\bLidl\\b|\\bTesco\\b" Expenses:Food:Groceries
